# text = At such a time I found out for certain , that this bleak place overgrown with nettles was the churchyard ; and that Philip Pirrip , late of this parish , and also Georgiana wife of the above , were dead and buried ; and that Alexander , Bartholomew , Abraham , Tobias , and Roger , infant children of the aforesaid , were also dead and buried ; and that the dark flat wilderness beyond the churchyard , intersected with dykes and mounds and gates , with scattered cattle feeding on it , was the marshes ; and that the low leaden line beyond , was the river ; and that the distant savage lair from which the wind was rushing , was the sea ; and that the small bundle of shivers growing afraid of it all and beginning to cry , was Pip cried a terrible voice , as a man started up from among the graves at the side of the church porch A fearful man , all in coarse grey , with a great iron on his leg .
