# text = The wonder and consternation with which Joe stopped on the threshold of his bite and stared at me , were too evident to escape my sister's observation said she , smartly , as she put down her cup muttered Joe , shaking his head at me in very serious remonstrance repeated my sister , more sharply than before said Joe , all aghast By this time , my sister was quite desperate , so she pounced on Joe , and , taking him by the two whiskers , knocked his head for a little while against the wall behind him : while I sat in the corner , looking guiltily on said my sister , out of breath Joe looked at her in a helpless way ; then took a helpless bite , and looked at me again said Joe , solemnly , with his last bite in his cheek and speaking in a confidential voice , as if we two were quite alone he moved his chair and looked about the floor between us , and then again at me cried my sister said Joe , looking at me , and not at Mrs .
