# text = But , I delivered this written communication ( slate and all ) with my own hand , and Joe received it as a miracle of erudition cried Joe , opening his blue eyes wide said I , glancing at the slate as he held it : with a misgiving that the writing was rather hilly said Joe I had never heard Joe read aloud to any greater extent than this monosyllable , and I had observed at church last Sunday when I accidentally held our Prayer-Book upside down , that it seemed to suit his convenience quite as well as if it had been all right .
