# text = Wishing to embrace the present occasion of finding out whether in teaching Joe , I should have to begin quite at the beginning , I said said Joe , looking at it with a slowly searching eye I leaned over Joe , and , with the aid of my forefinger , read him the whole letter said Joe , when I had finished I asked him , with a modest patronage said Joe said Joe said Joe he continued , after rubbing his knees a little , " when you do come to a J and a O , and says you how interesting reading is !" I derived from this last , that Joe's education , like Steam , was yet in its infancy , Pursuing the subject , I inquired said Joe , taking up the poker , and settling himself to his usual occupation when he was thoughtful , of slowly raking the fire between the lower bars Consequence , my mother and me we ran away from my father , several times ; and then my mother she'd go out to work , and she'd say she'd say and she'd put me to school .
