# text = Behind the furthest end of the brewery , was a rank garden with an old wall : not so high but that I could struggle up and hold on long enough to look over it , and see that the rank garden was the garden of the house , and that it was overgrown with tangled weeds , but that there was a track upon the green and yellow paths , as if some one sometimes walked there , and that Estella was walking away from me even then .
