# text = This mental exercise lasted until Biddy made a rush at them and distributed three defaced Bibles ( shaped as if they had been unskilfully cut off the chump-end of something ), more illegibly printed at the best than any curiosities of literature I have since met with , speckled all over with ironmould , and having various specimens of the insect world smashed between their leaves .
