# text = It appeared to me that it would take time , to become uncommon under these circumstances : nevertheless , I resolved to try it , and that very evening Biddy entered on our special agreement , by imparting some information from her little catalogue of Prices , under the head of moist sugar , and lending me , to copy at home , a large old English D which she had imitated from the heading of some newspaper , and which I supposed , until she told me what it was , to be a design for a buckle .
