# text = Estella left me standing near the door , and I stood there until Miss Havisham cast her eyes upon me from the dressing-table she said , without being startled or surprised with the impatient movement of her fingers I was obliged to answer in some confusion she demanded , with a searching look said Miss Havisham , impatiently I could answer this inquiry with a better heart than I had been able to find for the other question , and I said I was quite willing said she , pointing at the door behind me with her withered hand I crossed the staircase landing , and entered the room she indicated .
