# text = One Sunday when Joe , greatly enjoying his pipe , had so plumed himself on being that I had given him up for the day , I lay on the earthwork for some time with my chin on my hand , descrying traces of Miss Havisham and Estella all over the prospect , in the sky and in the water , until at last I resolved to mention a thought concerning them that had been much in my head said I returned Joe , slowly considering said Joe said Joe Joe felt , as I did , that he had made a point there , and he pulled hard at his pipe to keep himself from weakening it by repetition Joe pursued , as soon as he was past that danger Joe repeated , very emphatically I had thought of that too , and it was very far from comforting to me to find that he had thought of it ; for it seemed to render it more probable But Joe had got the idea of a present in his head and must harp upon it said he I interposed said Joe , still harping on it as though I had particularly pressed it said Joe , steadfastly impressing it upon me , as if he were endeavouring to rouse me from a fixed delusion I cried , in desperation , taking hold of his coat Joe assented , as if he had been contending for that , all along said Joe , gravely In brief , Joe thought that if I thought well of it , he thought well of it .
# sent_id = 997
