# text = My dream was out ; my wild fancy was surpassed by sober reality ; Miss Havisham was going to make my fortune on a grand scale pursued the lawyer My heart was beating so fast , and there was such a singing in my ears , that I could scarcely stammer I had no objection Once more , I stammered with difficulty that I had no objection Though he called me Mr . Pip , and began rather to make up to me , he still could not get rid of a certain air of bullying suspicion ; and even now he occasionally shut his eyes and threw his finger at me while he spoke , as much as to express that he knew all kinds of things to my disparagement , if he only chose to mention them . "
