# text = The very stars to which I then raised my eyes , I am afraid I took to be but poor and humble stars for glittering on the rustic objects among which I had passed my life said I , when we sat at our supper of bread-and-cheese and beer observed Joe , whose voice sounded hollow in his beer mug said Biddy said Joe , industriously cutting his bread , with his cheese on it , in the palm of his left hand , and glancing at my untasted supper as if he thought of the time when we used to compare slices said Joe Biddy asked me here , as she sat holding my sister's plate I returned with some resentment observed Joe Biddy said no more .
