# text = No more low wet grounds , no more dykes and sluices , no more of these grazing cattle - though they seemed , in their dull manner , to wear a more respectful air now , and to face round , in order that they might stare as long as possible at the possessor of such great expectations - farewell , monotonous acquaintances of my childhood , henceforth I was for London and greatness : not for smith's work in general and for you !
