# text = So , when we had walked home and had had tea , I took Biddy into our little garden by the side of the lane , and , after throwing out in a general way for the elevation of her spirits , that I should never forget her , said I had a favour to ask of her said I asked Biddy , with a steady sort of glance Although I was looking at Biddy as I spoke , and although she opened her eyes very wide when I had spoken , she did not look at me asked Biddy , plucking a black-currant leaf interrupted Biddy , looking closely at the leaf in her hand asked Biddy .
