# text = This was coming to the point , and I thought it a sensible way of expressing himself said Mr . Pumblechook , after snorting admiration at me for some moments I begged Mr . Pumblechook to remember that nothing was to be ever said or hinted , on that point said Mr . Pumblechook I murmured and Mr . Pumblechook took me by both hands again , and communicated a movement to his waistcoat , which had an emotional appearance , though it was rather low down said Mr . Pumblechook , in the way of a compassionate adjuration Thereupon he shook his head and tapped it , expressing his sense of deficiency in Joseph said Mr . Pumblechook said Mr . Pumblechook , getting up again the moment after he had sat down
