# text = This again was heightened by a certain gipsy character that set the banquet off ; for , while the table was , as Mr . Pumblechook might have said , the lap of luxury - being entirely furnished forth from the coffee-house - the circumjacent region of sitting-room was of a comparatively pastureless and shifty character : imposing on the waiter the wandering habits of putting the covers on the floor ( where he fell over them ), the melted butter in the armchair , the bread on the bookshelves , the cheese in the coalscuttle , and the boiled fowl into my bed in the next room - where I found much of its parsley and butter in a state of congelation when I retired for the night .
