# text = There , we found , sitting by a fire , a very old man in a flannel coat : clean , cheerful , comfortable , and well cared for , but intensely deaf said Wemmick , shaking hands with him in a cordial and jocose way replied the old man said Wemmick cried the old man , while I nodded as hard as I possibly could said Wemmick , contemplating the old man , with his hard face really softened giving him a tremendous one giving him a still more tremendous one I tipped him several more , and he was in great spirits .
