# text = Though I put it to yourself , sir , whether it were calc'lated to keep a man up to his work with a good hart , to be continiwally cutting in betwixt him and the Ghost with A man may have had a misfortun ' and been in the Church ," said Joe , lowering his voice to an argumentative and feeling tone A ghost-seeing effect in Joe's own countenance informed me that Herbert had entered the room .
