# text = At this time the coach was ready and the coachman impatient , and we were all preparing to get up , and the prisoners had come over with their keeper - bringing with them that curious flavour of bread-poultice , baize , rope-yarn , and hearthstone , which attends the convict presence pleaded the keeper to the angry passenger growled the convict I had recognized said the other , gruffly Then , they both laughed , and began cracking nuts , and spitting the shells about . -
