# text = Dinner done and we sitting with our feet upon the fender , I said to Herbert he returned said I Herbert crossed his feet , looked at the fire with his head on one side , and having looked at it in vain for some time , looked at me because I didn't go on said I , laying my hand upon his knee Instead of being transfixed , Herbert replied in an easy matter-of-course way said Herbert said I said I , to whom this was a new and not unwelcome light said Herbert I shook my head gloomily said I I returned returned Herbert , smiling , and clapping his hand on the back of mine I stopped for a moment to consider whether there really was this mixture in my character .
