# text = On the whole , I by no means recognized the analysis , but thought it not worth disputing I went on Herbert threw in , with his eyes on the fire ; which I thought kind and sympathetic of him In saying this , I relieved my mind of what had always been there , more or less , though no doubt most since yesterday Herbert replied , in his gay hopeful way I said I could not deny that this was a strong point .
