# text = And now before I say anything more about my father , or my father's son , and repay confidence with confidence , I want to make myself seriously disagreeable to you for a moment - positively repulsive said I said he though he spoke in this light tone , he was very much in earnest I turned my head aside , for , with a rush and a sweep , like the old marsh winds coming up from the sea , a feeling like that which had subdued me on the morning when I left the forge , when the mists were solemnly rising , and when I laid my hand upon the village finger-post , smote upon my heart again .
