# text = For all that I knew this perfectly well , I still felt as if it were not safe to let the coach-office be out of my sight longer than five minutes at a time ; and in this condition of unreason I had performed the first half-hour of a watch of four or five hours , when Wemmick ran against me said he I explained that I was waiting to meet somebody who was coming up by coach , and I inquired after the Castle and the Aged said Wemmick said I , for he was tending in that direction returned Wemmick I asked answered Wemmick , very drily I remarked said Wemmick , touching me on the breast with his forefinger I had so much time to spare , that the proposal came as a relief , notwithstanding its irreconcilability with my latent desire to keep my eye on the coach-office .
