# text = As we came out of the prison through the lodge , I found that the great importance of my guardian was appreciated by the turnkeys , no less than by those whom they held in charge said the turnkey , who kept us between the two studded and spiked lodge gates , and who carefully locked one before he unlocked the other returned Wemmick said the turnkey remarked Wemmick , turning to me with his post-office elongated asked the turnkey , with a grin at Mr . Wemmick's humour cried Wemmick said the turnkey , grinning again cried Wemmick , suddenly hitting out at the turnkey in a facetious way The turnkey laughed , and gave us good day , and stood laughing at us over the spikes of the wicket when we descended the steps into the street said Wemmick , gravely in my ear , as he took my arm to be more confidential I was very much impressed , and not for the first time , by my guardian's subtlety .
