# text = I Know that these gratifying social ends were so invariably accomplished , that Herbert and I understood nothing else to be referred to in the first standing toast of the society : which ran The Finches spent their money foolishly ( the Hotel we dined at was in Covent-garden ), and the first Finch I saw , when I had the honour of joining the Grove , was Bentley Drummle : at that time floundering about town in a cab of his own , and doing a great deal of damage to the posts at the street corners .
