# text = When we gradually fell into keeping late hours and late company , I noticed that he looked about him with a desponding eye at breakfast-time ; that he began to look about him more hopefully about mid-day ; that he drooped when he came into dinner ; that he seemed to descry Capital in the distance rather clearly , after dinner ; that he all but realized Capital towards midnight ; and that at about two o'clock in the morning , he became so deeply despondent again as to talk of buying a rifle and going to America , with a general purpose of compelling buffaloes to make his fortune .
