# text = After another silent turn in the garden , I fell back on the main position said I asked Biddy , stopping in the narrow garden walk , and looking at me under the stars with a clear and honest eye said I , as if I found myself compelled to give up Biddy in despair For which cogent reason I kept Biddy at a distance during supper , and , when I went up to my own old little room , took as stately a leave of her as I could , in my murmuring soul , deem reconcilable with the churchyard and the event of the day .
