# text = If they disclosed to me , as I suspect they did , that I should not come back , and that Biddy was quite right , all I can say is - they were quite right too Herbert and I went on from bad to worse , in the way of increasing our debts , looking into our affairs , leaving Margins , and the like exemplary transactions ; and Time went on , whether or no , as he has a way of doing ; and I came of age - in fulfilment of Herbert's prediction , that I should do so before I knew where I was .
