# text = On arriving before the battlements , I found the Union Jack flying and the drawbridge up ; but undeterred by this show of defiance and resistance , I rang at the gate , and was admitted in a most pacific manner by the Aged said the old man , after securing the drawbridge I nodded at the old gentleman as Wemmick himself might have nodded , and we went in and sat down by the fireside said the old man , in his chirping way , while he warmed his hands at the blaze I nodded I nodded hard I nodded harder said the old man Curious to know how the old gentleman stood informed concerning the reputation of Mr . Jaggers , I roared that name at him .
