# text = Her graceful figure and her beautiful face expressed a self-possessed indifference to the wild heat of the other , that was almost cruel exclaimed Miss Havisham said Estella , preserving her attitude of indifference as she leaned against the great chimney-piece and only moving her eyes was the fierce retort said Estella cried Miss Havisham , bitterly said Estella replied the other said Miss Havisham retorted Estella , never departing from the easy grace of her attitude , never raising her voice as the other did , never yielding either to anger or tenderness cried Miss Havisham , turning wildly to me returned Estella moaned Miss Havisham retorted Estella she touched her bosom with her hand moaned Miss Havisham , pushing away her grey hair with both her hands returned Estella moaned Miss Havisham , with her former action returned Estella Miss Havisham quite shrieked , as she stretched out her arms Estella looked at her for a moment with a kind of calm wonder , but was not otherwise disturbed ; when the moment was past , she looked down at the fire again said Estella , raising her eyes after a silence exclaimed Miss Havisham said Estella , in a musing way , after another moment of calm wonder Miss Havisham , with her head in her hands , sat making a low moaning , and swaying herself on her chair , but gave no answer said Estella Miss Havisham sat listening ( or it seemed so , for I could not see her face ), but still made no answer said Estella Miss Havisham had settled down , I hardly knew how , upon the floor , among the faded bridal relics with which it was strewn .
