# text = It was the one grain of relief I had he went on , taking my watch out of my pocket , and turning towards him a ring on my finger , while I recoiled from his touch as if he had been a snake turning his eyes round the room Again he took both my hands and put them to his lips , while my blood ran cold within me said he , after again drawing his sleeve over his eyes and forehead , as the click came in his throat which I well remembered - and he was all the more horrible to me that he was so much in earnest I returned I asked said he , with a glance of surprise O Estella , Estella O , that he had never come !
