# text = He took out of his pocket a great thick pocket-book , bursting with papers , and tossed it on the table he wound up , looking round the room and snapping his fingers once with a loud snap said I , almost in a frenzy of fear and dislike said he , laying his hand on my arm in a suddenly altered and subdued manner I resumed , half-groaning he said , in the same tone as before Some sense of the grimly-ludicrous moved me to a fretful laugh , as I replied he persisted said I he returned said he , taking his black pipe from his mouth , and dropping his jaw as he stared at me said I he returned said I said he , putting his pipe back in his mouth Once more , he took me by both hands and surveyed me with an air of admiring proprietorship : smoking with great complacency all the while .
