# text = But it was by no means so plain to Mr . Provis ( I resolved to call him by that name ), who reserved his consent to Herbert's participation until he should have seen him and formed a favourable judgment of his physiognomy said he , pulling a greasy little clasped black Testament out of his pocket To state that my terrible patron carried this little black book about the world solely to swear people on in cases of emergency , would be to state what I never quite established - but this I can say , that I never knew him put it to any other use .
