# text = He had so heated himself that he took out his handkerchief and wiped his face and head and neck and hands , before he could go on He regarded me with a look of affection that made him almost abhorrent to me again , though I had felt great pity for him He wiped himself again , as he had done before , and then slowly took his tangle of tobacco from his pocket , and plucked his pipe from his button-hole , and slowly filled it , and began to smoke I asked , after a silence with a fierce look Herbert had been writing with his pencil in the cover of a book .
