# text = He softly pushed the book over to me , as Provis stood smoking with his eyes on the fire , and I read in it I shut the book and nodded slightly to Herbert , and put the book by ; but we neither of us said anything , and both looked at Provis as he stood smoking by the fire Why should I pause to ask how much of my shrinking from Provis might be traced to Estella ?
