# text = When I had begun to advance Herbert's prospects by Stealth , I had been able to bear this with cheerful philosophy ; he and his affianced , for their part , had naturally not been very anxious to introduce a third person into their interviews ; and thus , although I was assured that I had risen in Clara's esteem , and although the young lady and I had long regularly interchanged messages and remembrances by Herbert , I had never seen her .
