# text = However , I did not trouble Wemmick with these particulars said Wemmick Much comforted by these considerations , I thanked Wemmick again and again , and begged him to proceed Wemmick , having finished his breakfast , here looked at his watch , and began to get his coat on said he , with his hands still in the sleeves his hands were now out of his sleeves , and I was shaking them He laid his hands upon my shoulders , and added in a solemn whisper Quite despairing of making my mind clear to Wemmick on this point , I forbore to try said Wemmick said I in a cheery shout piped the old man from within .
