# text = As we were thus conversing in a low tone while Old Barley's sustained growl vibrated in the beam that crossed the ceiling , the room door opened , and a very pretty slight dark-eyed girl of twenty or so , came in with a basket in her hand : whom Herbert tenderly relieved of the basket , and presented blushing , as She really was a most charming girl , and might have passed for a captive fairy , whom that truculent Ogre , Old Barley , had pressed into his service said Herbert , showing me the basket , with a compassionate and tender smile after we had talked a little
