# text = He had a bag of money in his pocket , like a pudding in the cloth , and on that property married a young person in bed-furniture , with great rejoicings ; the whole population of Portsmouth ( nine in number at the last Census ) turning out on the beach , to rub their own hands and shake everybody else's , and sing A certain dark-complexioned Swab , however , who wouldn't fill , or do anything else that was proposed to him , and whose heart was openly stated ( by the boatswain ) to be as black as his figure-head , proposed to two other Swabs to get all mankind into difficulties ; which was so effectually done ( the Swab family having considerable political influence ) that it took half the evening to set things right , and then it was only brought about through an honest little grocer with a white hat , black gaiters , and red nose , getting into a clock , with a gridiron , and listening , and coming out , and knocking everybody down from behind with the gridiron whom he couldn't confute with what he had overheard .
