# text = The cathedral chimes had at once a sadder and a more remote sound to me , as I hurried on avoiding observation , than they had ever had before ; so , the swell of the old organ was borne to my ears like funeral music ; and the rooks , as they hovered about the grey tower and swung in the bare high trees of the priory-garden , seemed to call to me that the place was changed , and that Estella was gone out of it for ever .
