# text = His words had given me a start Herbert bent forward to look at me more nearly , as if my reply had been rather more hurried or more eager than he could quite account for he said , touching it said I said Herbert said Herbert returned Herbert , in a tone of surprise , and again bending forward to get a nearer look at me pursued Herbert said I said I , after a short silence , in a hurried way answered Herbert , coming close again said Herbert , after taking time to examine me What purpose I had in view when I was hot on tracing out and proving Estella's parentage , I cannot say .
