# text = And I saw Wemmick's lips form the words said Mr Jaggers said Wemmick , rather reproachfully towards me As I thought the time was now come for pursuing the theme I had at heart , I said , turning on Mr . Jaggers said Mr . Jaggers , bending forward to look at his boots and then straightening himself Mr . Jaggers looked at me inquiringly , and repeated said Mr . Jaggers said Mr . Jaggers said I A certain stop that Mr . Jaggers came to in his manner - he was too self-possessed to change his manner , but he could not help its being brought to an indefinably attentive stop - assured me that he did not know who her father was .
