# text = And if he asked me why I wanted it and why I thought I had any right to it , I would tell him , little as he cared for such poor dreams , that I had loved Estella dearly and long , and that , although I had lost her and must live a bereaved life , whatever concerned her was still nearer and dearer to me than anything else in the world .
