# text = At first , a misgiving crossed me that Wemmick would be instantly dismissed from his employment ; but , it melted as I saw Mr . Jaggers relax into something like a smile , and Wemmick become bolder said Mr . Jaggers returned Wemmick said Mr . Jaggers , laying his hand upon my arm , and smiling openly returned Wemmick , growing bolder and bolder Again they exchanged their former odd looks , each apparently still distrustful that the other was taking him in said Mr . Jaggers returned Wemmick Mr . Jaggers nodded his head retrospectively two or three times , and actually drew a sigh said he He waited for me to declare that I quite understood that he expressly said that he admitted nothing said Mr . Jaggers
