# text = So the unfortunate Mike very humbly withdrew , and Mr . Jaggers and Wemmick appeared to have re-established their good understanding , and went to work again with an air of refreshment upon them as if they had just had lunch From Little Britain , I went , with my cheque in my pocket , to Miss Skiffins's brother , the accountant ; and Miss Skiffins's brother , the accountant , going straight to Clarriker's and bringing Clarriker to me , I had the great satisfaction of concluding that arrangement .
