# text = Here , were the Leith , Aberdeen , and Glasgow steamers , loading and unloading goods , and looking immensely high out of the water as we passed alongside ; here , were colliers by the score and score , with the coal-whippers plunging off stages on deck , as counterweights to measures of coal swinging up , which were then rattled over the side into barges ; here , at her moorings was to-morrow's steamer for Rotterdam , of which we took good notice ; and here to-morrow's for Hamburg , under whose bowsprit we crossed .
