# text = For , now , the last of the fleet of ships was round the last low point we had headed ; and the last green barge , straw-laden , with a brown sail , had followed ; and some ballast-lighters , shaped like a child's first rude imitation of a boat , lay low in the mud ; and a little squat shoal-lighthouse on open piles , stood crippled in the mud on stilts and crutches ; and slimy stakes stuck out of the mud , and slimy stones stuck out of the mud , and red landmarks and tidemarks stuck out of the mud , and an old landing-stage and an old roofless building slipped into the mud , and all about us was stagnation and mud .
