# text = He added that he did not pretend to say what he might or might not have done to Compeyson , but , that in the moment of his laying his hand on his cloak to identify him , that villain had staggered up and staggered back , and they had both gone overboard together ; when the sudden wrenching of him ( Magwitch ) out of our boat , and the endeavour of his captor to keep him in it , had capsized us .
