# text = The dreadful condition to which he was brought , was so appalling to both of us , that we could not refer to it in plainer words said Herbert said I I saw that his delicacy was avoiding the right word , so I said There was something charmingly cordial and engaging in the manner in which after saying as if it were the grave beginning of a portentous business exordium , he had suddenly given up that tone , stretched out his honest hand , and spoken like a schoolboy Herbert pursued I thanked her heartily , and I thanked him heartily , but said I could not yet make sure of joining him as he so kindly offered .
