# text = Whether I really had been down in Garden Court in the dead of the night , groping about for the boat that I supposed to be there ; whether I had two or three times come to myself on the staircase with great terror , not knowing how I had got out of bed ; whether I had found myself lighting the lamp , possessed by the idea that he was coming up the stairs , and that the lights were blown out ; whether I had been inexpressibly harassed by the distracted talking , laughing , and groaning , of some one , and had half suspected those sounds to be of my own making ; whether there had been a closed iron furnace in a dark corner of the room , and a voice had called out over and over again that Miss Havisham was consuming within it ; these were things that I tried to settle with myself and get into some order , as I lay that morning on my bed .
