# text = And as my extreme weakness prevented me from getting up and going to him , I lay there , penitently whispering Joe's eyes were red when I next found him beside me ; but , I was holding his hand , and we both felt happy said Joe said Joe , summing up with his judicial air Joe added , after a little grave reflection There Joe cut himself short , and informed me that I was to be talked to in great moderation , and that I was to take a little nourishment at stated frequent times , whether I felt inclined for it or not , and that I was to submit myself to all his orders .
