# text = He shook his head when I then asked him if she had recovered said Joe , in a tone of remonstrance , and by way of getting at it by degrees said Joe said Joe ; still determined , on my account , to come at everything by degrees said Joe said Joe , repeating the legal turn as if it did him infinite good I never discovered from whom Joe derived the conventional temperature of the four thousand pounds , but it appeared to make the sum of money more to him , and he had a manifest relish in insisting on its being cool .
