# text = The day happened to be Sunday , and when I looked on the loveliness around me , and thought how it had grown and changed , and how the little wild flowers had been forming , and the voices of the birds had been strengthening , by day and by night , under the sun and under the stars , while poor I lay burning and tossing on my bed , the mere remembrance of having burned and tossed there , came like a check upon my peace .
