# text = But , when I heard the Sunday bells , and looked around a little more upon the outspread beauty , I felt that I was not nearly thankful enough - that I was too weak yet , to be even that - and I laid my head on Joe's shoulder , as I had laid it long ago when he had taken me to the Fair or where not , and it was too much for my young senses .
