# text = I was so doubtful of myself now , and put so much trust in him , that I could not satisfy myself whether I ought to refer to it when he did not I asked him that evening , upon further consideration , as he smoked his pipe at the window returned Joe said Joe , in the placidest way I presently asked , with increasing diffidence said Joe , after meditating a long time , and looking rather evasively at the window-seat I was beginning , when Joe got up and came to my sofa said Joe , bending over me I was ashamed to answer him said Joe , as if I had answered said Joe said Joe , in his favourite argumentative way I observed , as Joe waited for me to speak Joe assented said Joe said Joe , quite charmed with his logical arrangement
