# text = Says you said I retorted Pumblechook said I Pumblechook went on here Pumblechook shook his head and hand at me Windy donkey as he was , it really amazed me that he could have the face to talk thus to mine said I , scornfully , as I finished my interrupted breakfast Pumblechook was now addressing the landlord With those words the Impostor shook them both by the hand , with an air , and left the house ; leaving me much more astonished than delighted by the virtues of that same indefinite I was not long after him in leaving the house too , and when I went down the High-street I saw him holding forth ( no doubt to the same effect ) at his shop door to a select group , who honoured me with very unfavourable glances as I passed on the opposite side of the way .
