# text = We owed so much to Herbert's ever cheerful industry and readiness , that I often wondered how I had conceived that old idea of his inaptitude , until I was one day enlightened by the reflection , that perhaps the inaptitude had never been in him at all , but had been in me For eleven years , I had not seen Joe nor Biddy with my bodily eyes-though they had both been often before my fancy in the East-when , upon an evening in December , an hour or two after dark , I laid my hand softly on the latch of the old kitchen door .
