# text = There , smoking his pipe in the old place by the kitchen firelight , as hale and as strong as ever though a little grey , sat Joe ; and there , fenced into the corner with Joe's leg , and sitting on my own little stool looking at the fire , was - I again said Joe , delighted when I took another stool by the child's side ( but I did not rumple his hair I thought so too , and I took him out for a walk next morning , and we talked immensely , understanding one another to perfection .
